/images/thumb/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Coated in Crawler Mucus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Coated_in_Basic_Poison_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Coated_in_Crawler_Mucus_(Condition)\" title=\"Coated in Crawler Mucus (Condition)\">Coated in Crawler Mucus</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Targets must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;13 Constitution Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Save_DCs\" title=\"Dice rolls\">DC</a>&nbsp;13 <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or become <a href=\"/wiki/Stricken_with_Crawler_Mucus_(Condition)\" title=\"Stricken with Crawler Mucus (Condition)\">Stricken with Crawler Mucus</a>.</li>\n<li>On a successful save, targets receive <a href=\"/wiki/Inoculated:_Crawler_Mucus_(Condition)\" title=\"Inoculated: Crawler Mucus (Condition)\">Inoculated: Crawler Mucus</a> for 2 turns</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Area:_Crawler_Mucus\"> Area: Crawler Mucus </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crawler_Mucus_(cloud)\" title=\"Crawler Mucus (cloud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/45px-Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/60px-Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Crawler Mucus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp/30px-Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Poison_Cloud_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Crawler_Mucus_(cloud)\" title=\"Crawler Mucus (cloud)\">Crawler Mucus</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icon