-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ferg_Drogher\" title=\"Ferg Drogher\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png/25px-Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png/38px-Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png/50px-Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ferg Drogher\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png/25px-Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Ferg_Drogher.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ferg_Drogher\" title=\"Ferg Drogher\">Ferg Drogher</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fytz\" title=\"Fytz\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png/25px-Portrait_Fytz.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png/38px-Portrait_Fytz.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png/50px-Portrait_Fytz.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fytz the Firecracker\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png/25px-Portrait_Fytz.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fytz\" title=\"Fytz\">Fytz the Firecracker</a> south of the <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> Central Wall waypoint</li></ul></li>\n<li>Crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle\" title=\"Salts of Carrion Crawler Tentacle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png/30px-Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png/40px-Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png/20px-Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Extract_Brown_Salts_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Salts_of_Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle\" title=\"Salts of Carrion Crawler Tentacle\">Salts of Carrion Crawler Tentacle</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle\" title=\"Carrion Crawler Tentacle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle_Item_Icon.png/20px-Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle_Item_Icon.png/30px-Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle_Item_Icon.png/40px-Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle_Item_Icon.png/20px-Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Carrion_Crawler_Tentacle\" title=\"Carrion Crawler Tentacle\">Carrion Crawler Tentacle</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Vitriol\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vitriol\">Vitriol</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The saving throw to remove this condition occurs at the end of an affected character's turn. This means that if a character starts their turn with this condition, they will first lose their turn before they can make a saving throw to remove the condition.</li>\n<li>The item <a href=\"/wiki/Karabasan%27s_Poison\" title=\"Karabasan's Poison\">Karabasan's Poison</a> has the same effect as this item and applies the \"Coated in Crawler Mucus\" status when used.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 446.66666666667px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 444.66666666667px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Render by Konstantin Melnik\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg/667px-Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg/1001px-Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg/1334px-Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Render by Konstantin Melnik\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg/667px-Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"445\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Konstantin-melnik-cons-f.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Render by Konstantin Melnik</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 152px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a hr